  "sourceTitle": "Apricot Honey Ham Glaze",
  "sourceText": "Apricot Honey Ham Glaze\nBy: Sheri Wetherell\nPublished: Thursday, April 14, 2011 - 2:48pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 cup apricot preserves\n1/2 cup honey\n1 tablespoon cornstarch\n3 tablespoons lemon juice\n1/4 teaspoon ground cloves\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients in a saucepan over medium heat. Heat, stirring constantly, until thickened and bubbly. 2 Baste frequently during last 30 minutes of baking.",
